  "description": "<h3 class=\"h3\">Made-to-Order SmartGlass Privacy Windows</h3>\r\n<div class=\"rte\">\r\n<p>The beauty and versatility of eGlass Windows is every homeowner's dream. These are not your ordinary windows. They're user-controlled for complete on-demand privacy, and operated by simply flipping a wall switch<span>&nbsp;</span><em>(also compatible with mobile and voice command devices.)<span>&nbsp;</span></em>When switched ON, glass is Transparent &mdash; when switched OFF, glass is Private.</p>\r\n<p>Whether for new construction or replacement, eGlass Windows are available in hundreds of sizes. Your windows will be shipped directly to your home complete with everything you need for installation, including a<span>&nbsp;</span><em>Power Surge Protector</em>, a<span>&nbsp;</span><em>Decora Wall Switch</em>, and<span>&nbsp;</span><em>clearly written installation instructions.</em></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<h6><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Why Buy from eGlassWindows.com?</span></h6>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>As a division of Innovative Glass Corp, we've manufactured the&nbsp;highest quality \"Smart\"&nbsp;windows since 2003</li>\r\n<li>We provide award-winning customer service</li>\r\n<li>Our products are shipped directly to your home, ready for installation</li>\r\n<li>If you don't see what you're looking for we can customize any order</li>\r\n<li>We provide a full 2-year warranty</li>\r\n<li>You can increase your home value and make it more energy efficient</li>\r\n<li>You may be eligible for cost-saving tax credits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>",
